8,"Dogon, Ana Tinga | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/dti/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..twqL3OssTMhUjDF2t8D9IYgPA4uUg_dRjE-Ycu98EX8,"Ana Tinga Dogon is an endangered indigenous language of Mali. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.","Dogon, Ana Tinga",Niger-Congo
